{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_011","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Events Ambassadors Developer Funding XRPL Jobs Dev Blog XRPL Grants GitHub Report a Scam","location_hint":"paragraph 32","char_start":763,"char_end":851,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_012","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"XChainAddAccountCreateAttestation","location_hint":"paragraph 113","char_start":2440,"char_end":2473,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_013","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"XChainAddAccountCreateAttestation","location_hint":"paragraph 201","char_start":4089,"char_end":4122,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_014","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":4353,"char_end":4383,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_015","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Accept an offer to buy or sell a non-fungible token (NFT) . This transaction has two modes:","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4651,"char_end":4742,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_016","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"In direct mode, a buyer can accept a sell offer directly, or a seller can accept a buy offer directly.","location_hint":"paragraph 228","char_start":4746,"char_end":4848,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_017","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"In brokered mode, a third party (the broker ) can match two distinct offers, one buying and one selling. If the buy price is higher than the sell price, the broker can claim the difference as a fee for themself.","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4850,"char_end":5061,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_018","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Requires the NonFungibleTokensV1_1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":5065,"char_end":5122,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_019","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Example NFTokenAcceptOffer JSON","location_hint":"paragraph 231","char_start":5124,"char_end":5155,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_020","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"{\n\"Account\" : \"r9spUPhPBfB6kQeF6vPhwmtFwRhBh2JUCG\" ,\n\"Fee\" : \"12\" ,\n\"LastLedgerSequence\" : 75447550 ,\n\"Memos\" : [\n{\n\"Memo\" : {\n\"MemoData\" : \"61356534373538372D633134322D346663382D616466362D393666383562356435386437\"\n}\n}\n],\n\"NFTokenSellOffer\" : \"68CD1F6F906494EA08C9CB5CAFA64DFA90D4E834B7151899B73231DE5A0C3B77\" ,\n\"Sequence\" : 68549302 ,\n\"TransactionType\" : \"NFTokenAcceptOffer\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":5161,"char_end":5539,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_021","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The mode in which the transaction operates depends on the presence of the NFTokenSellOffer and NFTokenBuyOffer fields of the transaction:","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5594,"char_end":5731,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_022","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"NFTokenSellOffer NFTokenBuyOffer Mode","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5735,"char_end":5772,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_023","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"If neither of those fields is specified, the transaction is malformed and produces a tem class error.","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5816,"char_end":5917,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_024","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The semantics of brokered mode are slightly different than direct mode: the account sending the transaction acts as a broker, bringing the two offers together and causing them to be matched, but does not acquire ownership of the involved NFToken . If the transaction is successful, the NFToken is sent directly from the seller to the buyer.","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":5919,"char_end":6259,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_025","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The NFToken changes ownership, meaning that the token is removed from the NFTokenPage of the existing owner and added to the NFTokenPage of the new owner.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6312,"char_end":6466,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_026","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Funds are transferred from the buyer to the seller, as specified in the NFTokenOffer . If the NFToken has a transfer fee, then its issuer receives the specified percentage, and the rest goes to the seller.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":6468,"char_end":6673,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_027","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The transaction fails with a tec -class code if:","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":6677,"char_end":6725,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_028","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The buyer already owns the NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":6729,"char_end":6765,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_029","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The seller is not the current owner of the NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":6767,"char_end":6819,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_030","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"One or both offers in the transaction have already expired.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":6821,"char_end":6880,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_031","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The sell offer specifies a specific destination account, and the sender of the transaction is not that account.","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":6882,"char_end":6993,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_032","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"The sender of this transaction owns the buy or sell offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":6995,"char_end":7053,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_033","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"In addition to the common fields , NFTokenAcceptOffer transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 254","char_start":7092,"char_end":7184,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_034","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 255","char_start":7188,"char_end":7239,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_035","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"NFTokenSellOffer String - Hash UInt256 No Identifies the NFTokenOffer that offers to sell the NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 256","char_start":7243,"char_end":7346,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_036","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"NFTokenBuyOffer String - Hash UInt256 No Identifies the NFTokenOffer that offers to buy the NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 257","char_start":7348,"char_end":7449,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_037","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"NFTokenBrokerFee Currency Amount Amount No Brokered mode only. The amount that the broker keeps as their fee for bringing the two offers together; the remaining amount is sent to the seller of the NFT. If specified, the fee must be such that, before applying the transfer fee, the amount that the seller would receive is at least as much as the amount indicated in the sell offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 258","char_start":7451,"char_end":7831,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_038","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"In direct mode, you must specify either the NFTokenSellOffer or the NFTokenBuyOffer field. In brokered mode, you must specify both fields.","location_hint":"paragraph 259","char_start":7835,"char_end":7973,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_039","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"This functionality is intended to allow the owner of an NFToken to offer their token for sale to a third party broker, who may then attempt to sell the NFToken on for a larger amount, without the broker having to own the NFToken or custody funds.","location_hint":"paragraph 260","char_start":7975,"char_end":8221,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_040","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"If both offers are for the same asset, it is possible that the order in which funds are transferred might cause a transaction that would succeed to fail due to a lack of funds. To ensure deterministic transaction execution and maximize the chances of successful execution, the account attempting to buy the NFToken is debited first. Funds due to the broker are credited before crediting the seller.","location_hint":"paragraph 261","char_start":8223,"char_end":8621,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_041","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"In brokered mode, the offers referenced by NFTokenBuyOffer and NFTokenSellOffer must both specify the same NFTokenID ; that is, both must be for the same NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 262","char_start":8623,"char_end":8786,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_042","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, NFTokenAcceptOffer transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 264","char_start":8801,"char_end":8939,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_043","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"temDISABLED The NonFungibleTokensV1 amendment is not enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 266","char_start":8969,"char_end":9030,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_044","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"temMALFORMED The transaction was not validly formatted. For example, it specified neither NFTokenSellOffer nor NFTokenBuyOffer , or it specified a negative NFTokenBrokerFee .","location_hint":"paragraph 267","char_start":9032,"char_end":9206,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_045","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecCANT_ACCEPT_OWN_NFTOKEN_OFFER The buyer and seller are the same account.","location_hint":"paragraph 268","char_start":9208,"char_end":9283,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_046","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecEXPIRED An offer specified in the transaction has already expired.","location_hint":"paragraph 269","char_start":9285,"char_end":9354,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_047","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecINSUFFICIENT_FUNDS The buyer does not have the full amount they are offering. If the buy amount is specified in XRP, this could be because of the reserve requirement . If the buy amount is a token, it could be because the token is frozen .","location_hint":"paragraph 270","char_start":9356,"char_end":9598,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_048","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecINSUFFICIENT_PAYMENT In brokered mode, the buy amount offered is not high enough to pay the BrokerFee and the sell cost of the NFToken .","location_hint":"paragraph 271","char_start":9600,"char_end":9739,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_049","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecOBJECT_NOT_FOUND One of the offers specified in the transaction does not exist in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 272","char_start":9741,"char_end":9837,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_050","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecNFTOKEN_BUY_SELL_MISMATCH In brokered mode, the two offers are not a valid match. For example, the seller is asking more than the buyer is offering, the buy and sell offer are denominated in different assets, or the seller specified a destination that is not the buyer or the broker.","location_hint":"paragraph 273","char_start":9839,"char_end":10125,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_034a20f9fcbf_051","source_id":"src_034a20f9fcbf","source_hash":"ee8083b886c2e639991c685b3723058559775e04caabb5d568b4c75bac02cf61","text":"tecNFTOKEN_OFFER_TYPE_MISMATCH The object identified by the NFTokenBuyOffer is not actually a buy offer, or the object identified by the NFTokenSellOffer is not actually a sell offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 274","char_start":10127,"char_end":10310,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:39.145Z"}
